I believe DRT offers a valuable lens for understanding predictive processing and cognitive dissonance across both biological and artificial substrates. By reframing decision-making as conflict and predictive dissonance resolution, we can develop more proactive, transparent approaches for steering complex intelligent systems while better interpreting their internal mechanics. Ultimately, achieving this understanding begins with recognizing the fundamental role of dissonance in both man and machine.

